ction .config-guide {background: var(--bg-surface);border-left: 4px solid var(--line-color);padding: 24px 28px;margin-bottom: 20px}\n.config-guide h3 {font-size: 1.1rem;margin-bottom: 8px}\n.config-guide p {font-size: 0.93rem;color: var(--text-secondary)}\n.faq-container {display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 16px}\ndetails.faq-item {background: var(--bg-surface);border-left: 4px solid var(--line-color);padding: 18px 24px;box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);transition: border-color 0.2s ease}\ndetails.faq-item[open] {border-left-color: var(--accent-purple)}\nsummary.faq-question {font-size: 1.05rem;font-weight: 700;cursor: pointer;list-style: none;display: flex;justify-content: space-between;align-items: center;color: var(--text-primary)}\nsummary.faq-question::-webkit-details-marker {display: none}\nsummary.faq-question::after {content: \"+\";font-size: 1.2rem;color: var(--accent-purple);font-weight: 400;margin-left: 12px}\ndetails[open] summary.faq-question::after {content: \"–\"}\n.faq-answer {margin-top: 14px;font-size: 0.95rem;color: var(--text-secondary);line-height: 1.7}\nnav.fixed-bottom-nav {position: fixed;bottom: 0;left: 0;width: 100%;background: rgba(24, 25, 28, 0.94);backdrop-filter: blur(8px);-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);padding: 14px 24px;z-index: 99}\n.nav-content {max-width: 840px;margin: 0 auto;display: flex;justify-content: space-between;align-items: center}\n.nav-brand-mark {font-weight: 800;color: #ffffff;font-size: 0.95rem;letter-spacing: 0.04em}\n.nav-brand-mark span {color: var(--accent-purple-light)}\n.nav-links {display: flex;gap: 20px}\n.nav-links a {color: #d1d5db;font-size: 0.88rem;font-weight: 500;transition: color 0.2s}\n.nav-links a:hover {color: #ffffff}\nfooter.site-colophon {margin-top: 60px;padding-top: 32px;border-top: 1px solid var(--line-color);font-size: 0.85rem;color: var(--text-muted)}\n@media (max-width: 640px) {\n  h1.brand-title {font-size: 2.1rem}\n  .plan-strip-card {padding: 24px 20px}\n  .plan-header {flex-direction: column;align-items: flex-start}\n  .plan-price-group {text-align: left}\n  nav.fixed-bottom-nav {padding: 12px 16px}\n  .nav-links {gap: 14px}\n  .nav-links a {font-size: 0.8rem}\n}\n</style><main class=\"wrapper\">\n  <header class=\"timeline-hero\" id=\"overview\">\n    <div class=\"hero-tagline\">Network Architecture &amp; Records</div>\n    <h1 class=\"brand-title\">水墨云(Ink)：数据流向与边界纪实</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead-narrative\">\n      对分布式网络而言，连接不仅是一组套接字，更是对延时抖动、跨域中继与可用带宽的细致权衡。水墨云(Ink) 建立在对路径持续校准的基调之上，将工程化的分流逻辑转化为透明的日常服务。\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"hero-timeline\">\n      <div class=\"timeline-node\">\n        <span class=\"timeline-date\">PHASE I · 骨架设立</span>\n        <div class=\"timeline-title\">拓扑探索与节点池基线</div>\n        <div class=\"timeline-desc\">梳理多接入点间的基础路径，建立涵盖核心交换枢纽的普通中继池，确立最基础的多端协同调度原则。</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"timeline-node\">\n        <span class=\"timeline-date\">PHASE II · 链路定向</span>\n        <div class=\"timeline-title\">专线中继与高并发承载</div>\n        <div class=\"timeline-desc\">引入低抖动专线链路与针对流媒体验证的定向路由，平衡高峰期互联波动与吞吐瓶颈。</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"timeline-node\">\n        <span class=\"timeline-date\">PHASE III · 秩序沉淀</span>\n        <div class=\"timeline-title\">梯度订阅与长效保障机制</div>\n        <div class=\"timeline-desc\">以分级资源池应对个人、跨地域协作与高吞吐团队的异质化需求，形成全周期的网络服务矩阵。</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <section id=\"infrastructure\">\n    <span class=\"section-meta\">Technical Notes</span>\n    <h2 class=\"section-heading\">路由哲学与调度机制</h2>\n    <p class=\"section-intro\">我们在设计分流通讯时，优先考虑可预期性，而非短时极值。网络状态的剧烈振荡往往来源于边界网关的超额复用。</p>\n\n    <div class=\"narrative-block\">\n      <h3>自适应分流原则</h3>\n      <p>规则集并不是越繁复越好。通过解析目标域名的真实拓扑，将流量划分为直连回源与隧道中继，不仅能减少无谓的中转损耗，更能为高优先级进程保留洁净的数据走廊。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"narrative-block\">\n      <h3>端点多路复用</h3>\n      <p>从个人单机到团队集群，多设备并行的瓶颈常出现在握手风暴与会话保持上。针对这一特性，服务端预留了足够的并发通路，以应对瞬间膨胀的数据交换。</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"plans\">\n    <span class=\"section-meta\">Tiers &amp; Access</span>\n    <h2 class=\"section-heading\">服务阶梯与订阅计划</h2>\n    <p class=\"section-intro\">水墨云(Ink) 提供梯度明确的额度配置。依据设备规模、峰值带宽需求与调度保障级别，选择适合当前环境的方案。</p>\n\n    <div class=\"plans-stack\">\n      <article class=\"plan-strip-card\">\n        <div class=\"plan-header\">\n          <div class=\"plan-name\">基础版</div>\n          <div class=\"plan-price-group\">\n            <span class=\"plan-price\">¥15</span><span class=\"plan-cycle\">/ 月</span>\n            <div>按年付仅需 ¥150/年</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"features-list\">\n          <li>每月 100GB 极速流量</li>\n          <li>支持 3 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>解锁基础流媒体</li>\n          <li>普通线路节点池</li>\n        </ul>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"plan-strip-card featured\">\n        <span class=\"plan-badge\">编辑推荐</span>\n        <div class=\"plan-header\">\n          <div class=\"plan-name\">旗舰版</div>\n          <div class=\"plan-price-group\">\n            <span class=\"plan-price\">¥35</span><span class=\"plan-cycle\">/ 月</span>\n            <div>按年付仅需 ¥350/年</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"features-list\">\n          <li>每月 300GB 极速流量</li>\n          <li>支持 5 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>全节点原生流媒体解锁</li>\n          <li>IPLC 专线游戏加速优化</li>\n          <li>7x24 优先工单支持</li>\n        </ul>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"plan-strip-card\">\n        <div class=\"plan-header\">\n          <div class=\"plan-name\">团队版</div>\n          <div class=\"plan-price-group\">\n            <span class=\"plan-price\">¥85</span><span class=\"plan-cycle\">/ 月</span>\n            <div>按年付仅需 ¥850/年</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"features-list\">\n          <li>每月 1000GB 极速流量</li>\n          <li>支持 20 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>VIP 专属高带宽节点</li>\n          <li>支持企业定制路由</li>\n          <li>专属客户经理服务</li>\n        </ul>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"client-section\" id=\"clients\">\n    <span class=\"section-meta\">Integration</span>\n    <h2 class=\"section-heading\">客户端支持与协议接入</h2>\n    <p class=\"section-intro\">水墨云(Ink) 遵循开放协议标准，不强制绑定排他性单一软件。用户可在多平台借助通用工具导入订阅。</p>\n\n    <div class=\"config-guide\">\n      <h3>跨平台核心接入指引</h3>\n      <p>服务提供标准通用的订阅链接，兼容 macOS、Windows、iOS、Android 以及各类网关环境。只需将控制台获取的 URI 填入受支持的核心配置器中，即可完成节点同步与路由规则匹配。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"config-guide\">\n      <h3>分流规则维护建议</h3>\n      <p>推荐采用基于轻量规则集的自动匹配模式。保持基础 IP 数据库处于最新状态，有助于更精准地将境内外数据包导流至相应出口，避免本地网络出现冗余延迟。</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section id=\"faq\">\n    <span class=\"section-meta\">Inquiries</span>\n    <h2 class=\"section-heading\">常设问答备忘</h2>\n    <p class=\"section-intro\">针对节点选择、订阅周期转换以及异常调试的集中解构。</p>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-container\">\n      <details class=\"faq-item\">\n        <summary class=\"faq-question\">如何选择适合自己的计划版本？</summary>\n        <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n          如果仅用于日常个人网页浏览与低频多媒体访问，基础版的 100GB 配额通常绰绰有余；对于对连线低延迟有严苛要求，或多端协同较频繁的重度用户，配备 IPLC 专线优化与专属保障的旗舰版是更稳妥的折中选项；团队版则专注于高吞吐集群与多会话场景。\n        </div>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"faq-item\">\n        <summary class=\"faq-question\">订阅流量的重置周期是如何计算的？</summary>\n        <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n          流量配额通常按自然月或账单日自动重置。若当月额度提前耗尽，节点将暂停中转转发功能，直至下一个计费周期开始或通过控制台进行临时增配。\n        </div>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"faq-item\">\n        <summary class=\"faq-question\">多设备同时在线的判定机制是什么？</summary>\n        <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n          系统以同一时间段内发起活跃 TCP/UDP 握手的不同出口 IP 或识别凭据为准。超出套餐规定数量的新会话将被系统阻断，直至既有连接自然释放或休眠。\n        </div>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"faq-item\">\n        <summary class=\"faq-question\">是否提供专属技术支持渠道？</summary>\n        <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n          是的。基础版提供常规工单队列处理；旗舰版支持 7x24 优先工单流转；团队版用户则配备专属客户经理，以协同处理路由定制与异常链路排查。\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer class=\"site-colophon\">\n    <p>© 水墨云(Ink). 保留所有权利。专栏记录由网络编辑组独立维护。</p>\n  </footer>\n</main>\n\n<nav class=\"fixed-bottom-nav\">\n  <div class=\"nav-content\">\n    <div class=\"nav-brand-mark\">水墨云 <span>Ink</span></div>\n    <div class=\"nav-links\">\n      <a href=\"#overview\">纪实</a>\n      <a href=\"#infrastructure\">路由</a>\n      <a href=\"#plans\">计划</a>\n      <a href=\"#clients\">接入</a>\n      <a href=\"#faq\">答疑</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</nav>",
